  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "e34c1ecc-6bc8-4400-b6d5-085fb3faa181"],
 " count returns one representative. An integer count requests exactly that \
many distinct representatives and returns ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"{", "}"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "d566105d-6e63-44a0-b324-7388468797c2"],
 " when too few exist."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"a769c90d-84de-45e6-855f-50081159ee16"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"\"\<NextVertexFunction\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "Identity"}]], 
  "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "f56194f7-824c-4fde-9d56-9a8d8e0505d3"],
 " selects deterministically. Default ",
 Cell[BoxData["All"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "34b30c09-7eb9-45e9-8427-c43ed36f26e2"],
 " does not advance random state. Seed an ordinary draw with ",
 Cell[BoxData["SeedRandom"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "2bf95206-d2f8-4292-b24d-bc511a124d28"],
 "."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"c5c6c925-1a0c-4f3a-ae84-2aa9321ae559"],

